 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "hi i need help!! my internet is barely working and my bill is way too high this month 😡",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Hello! Thanks for contacting Nimbus Telecom. I'm Meera. I'd be happy to help you with your network and billing concerns today. 😊",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Before we dive into the details, could you please provide your account number and date of birth for verification?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "sure. account no is 72265799 and my dob is 21/05/1994",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you, Emily Reddy. I can see your account. I'm sorry to hear you've been having such a frustrating experience with your connection and the billing error.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "yeah its been awful. i keep dropping calls and the wifi is super slow. also i was charged twice for the premium package!!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I've checked the logs and it looks like there is a signal issue in your area. I will raise a network ticket right now to get our engineers to investigate the local tower.",
      "tags": [
        "action:technician_or_ticket"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "thanks. what about the double charge? i want my money back.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I see the error. I'll raise a refund request for the duplicate charge for you.",
      "tags": [
        "action:refund_request"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Please keep in mind that all credits are subject to approval and typically take 7-10 business days to appear in your account.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "ok that sounds fair. thanks for sorting this out so quickly meera!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You're very welcome! Just to recap, I've raised the network ticket and the refund request. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "nope that's all. have a great day!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You too! Thanks for choosing Nimbus Telecom. Goodbye!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
